# ── THIS REPO IS PUBLIC ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# omega-twin's scaffold is delivered as a tarball, not through here. It
# carries Tommy's cell number (SETUP.md), partner emails and the client
# list (CLAUDE.md). Extracting it at the repo root is the natural thing
# to do -- bootstrap.sh says `cd twin-scaffold` -- and without this line
# the next `git add -A` publishes all of it. The twin service lives in
# clearskyenergy/omega-twin, which is private.
twin-scaffold/
